\title{dbparser.mcp: Model Context Protocol Server for 'dbparser'}
\description{
A local, read-only 'Model Context Protocol' ('MCP') server for the 'dbparser' package. It lets 'MCP' clients such as 'Claude Code' and 'Claude Desktop' parse the user's own local drug and gene database files, describe the parsed tables and read capped rows from them, always with the source's release, licence and attribution. It runs over standard input and output only, reads only local files and never downloads data.
